meta {
  name: Deduct Stock
  type: http
  seq: 25
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/restaurants/{{restaurant_id}}/inventory/items/{{item_id}}/stock
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
      "type": "deduct",
      "quantity": 2,
      "note": "Sent to the Gulshan branch"
  }
}

docs {
  Owner/manager. Takes stock out by hand, drawn from the earliest-expiring batch. It counts as usage (COGS), so note is required for deduct: 422 "Say why this stock is being taken out by hand." without it.

  Food thrown away is waste, not a deduct: use type waste with a reason (see Waste Stock).
  422 on quantity when it would take the stock below zero.
}
